From: Bruno Costa <bruno.costa@cat.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:09:16 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Honda City 2023 (Brazil) on openpilot v0.9.9 for the
 black panda

Branch off tag v0.9.9 (8aadf02b). Only the opendbc submodule moves:
e370a036 -> kriptomad/opendbc ae690dd7 (branch firmwarecityg7-v0.9.9), which is
v0.9.9's opendbc plus:
  - commaai/opendbc 43006b9a "Honda: Honda City (Brazil only) 2023 (#2425)"
  - HAS_EPB auto-detection backported from commaai/opendbc 6fa346ed (#2458); the City
    does not send 0x1C2 EPB_STATUS and v0.9.9 required it for every Bosch car
  - explicit cvt transmissionType for HONDA_CITY_7G
  - test route 56b2cf1dacdcd033/00000017--d24ffdb376, CARS.md row

panda stays at e462c34d (last revision with black panda / STM32F4 support).
.gitmodules points the opendbc submodule at ../../kriptomad/opendbc.git so the
fork-relative URL resolves to the repo that actually contains the commit.
docs/CARS.md and RELEASES.md updated by hand in the v0.9.9 generator format.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .gitmodules  | 2 +-
 RELEASES.md  | 7 +++++++
 docs/CARS.md | 3 ++-
 opendbc_repo | 2 +-
 4 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

